{"id":"fd304c64ff2b4cf0","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-riemann-roch.md","title":"Riemann–Roch Equality Datum","display":"df-riemann-roch — Riemann–Roch Equality Datum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-riemann-roch","aliases":["58-df-riemann-roch"],"display":"df-riemann-roch — Riemann–Roch Equality Datum","depends_on":["[[58-df-compact-riemann-surface.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-canonical-divisor.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-riemann-roch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-riemann-roch</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-riemann-roch — Riemann–Roch Equality Datum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5591939bd3612ac0\" href=\"?note=5591939bd3612ac0\" title=\"58-df-compact-riemann-surface.md\">58-df-compact-riemann-surface.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3042e345de149e5\" href=\"?note=a3042e345de149e5\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-canonical-divisor.md\">../batch03/58-df-canonical-divisor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathrm{Div}_X,D,K,\\Omega_X^{\\mathrm{top}},\\operatorname{div}_X,\\sim_X,-_D,h^0_X,\\deg_X,g\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathrm{Div}_X,D,K,\\Omega_X^{\\mathrm{top}},\\operatorname{div}_X,\\sim_X,-_D,h^0_X,\\deg_X,g\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CanonicalDivisorData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CanonicalDivisorData}_S\\)</span> are the exact upstream predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannRochData}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannRochData}_S\\)</span> is the equality-data predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}roch}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RiemannRochData}_S\n(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathrm{Div}_X,D,K,\\Omega_X^{\\mathrm{top}},\n\\operatorname{div}_X,\\sim_X,-_D,h^0_X,\\deg_X,g)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\n\\land D,K\\in\\mathrm{Div}_X\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{CanonicalDivisorData}_S\n(K;X,\\mathrm{Div}_X,\\Omega_X^{\\mathrm{top}},\\operatorname{div}_X,\\sim_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(-_D,\\mathrm{Div}_X\\times\\mathrm{Div}_X,\\mathrm{Div}_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h^0_X,\\mathrm{Div}_X,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\deg_X,\\mathrm{Div}_X,\\mathbb Z)\n\\land g\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land h^0_X(D)-h^0_X(K-_D D)=\\deg_X(D)+1-g.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}roch}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RiemannRochData}_S\n(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathrm{Div}_X,D,K,\\Omega_X^{\\mathrm{top}},\n\\operatorname{div}_X,\\sim_X,-_D,h^0_X,\\deg_X,g)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\n\\land D,K\\in\\mathrm{Div}_X\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{CanonicalDivisorData}_S\n(K;X,\\mathrm{Div}_X,\\Omega_X^{\\mathrm{top}},\\operatorname{div}_X,\\sim_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(-_D,\\mathrm{Div}_X\\times\\mathrm{Div}_X,\\mathrm{Div}_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h^0_X,\\mathrm{Div}_X,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\deg_X,\\mathrm{Div}_X,\\mathbb Z)\n\\land g\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land h^0_X(D)-h^0_X(K-_D D)=\\deg_X(D)+1-g.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology, complex atlas, divisor carrier, canonical-divisor data, subtraction, section-dimension map, degree map, and genus value are explicit. The predicate records the equality relative to those data rather than inferring them from the bare carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-compact-riemann-surface.md","status":"resolved","id":"5591939bd3612ac0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-compact-riemann-surface.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-canonical-divisor.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3042e345de149e5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-canonical-divisor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathrm{Div}_X,D,K,\\Omega_X^{\\mathrm{top}},\\operatorname{div}_X,\\sim_X,-_D,h^0_X,\\deg_X,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CanonicalDivisorData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannRochData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}roch}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RiemannRochData}_S\n(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathrm{Div}_X,D,K,\\Omega_X^{\\mathrm{top}},\n\\operatorname{div}_X,\\sim_X,-_D,h^0_X,\\deg_X,g)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\n\\land D,K\\in\\mathrm{Div}_X\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{CanonicalDivisorData}_S\n(K;X,\\mathrm{Div}_X,\\Omega_X^{\\mathrm{top}},\\operatorname{div}_X,\\sim_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(-_D,\\mathrm{Div}_X\\times\\mathrm{Div}_X,\\mathrm{Div}_X)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h^0_X,\\mathrm{Div}_X,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\deg_X,\\mathrm{Div}_X,\\mathbb Z)\n\\land g\\in\\omega\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land h^0_X(D)-h^0_X(K-_D D)=\\deg_X(D)+1-g.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1740,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1094","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-riemann-roch.md|58-df-riemann-roch]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["5591939bd3612ac0","a3042e345de149e5","36d7463d215be751"]}